    <DataNode elementId="AT4G35260-MONOMER" textLabel="Isocitrate dehydrogenase [NAD] regulatory subunit 1, mitochondrial" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT4G35260-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="750" centerY="755" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The IDH-I gene is predicted to encode a regulatory subunit of the mitochondrially-localized NAD+-dependent isocitrate lyase |CITS:[17468208][14671022]|. &lt;i&gt;idhi&lt;/i&gt; mutants have reduced levels of NAD+-dependent isocitrate lyase activity |CITS: [17468208]|.</Comment>
