    <DataNode elementId="AT3G15020-MONOMER" textLabel="Malate dehydrogenase 2, mitochondrial" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT3G15020-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="750" centerY="835" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">mMDH2 is one of two mitochondrial malate dehydrogenases in Arabidopsis thaliana. Although an &lt;i&gt;mdh2-1&lt;/i&gt; mutant does not have an obviously aberrant phenotype, an &lt;i&gt;mmdh1-2 mmdh2-1&lt;/i&gt; double mutant has lower levels of leaf malate dehydrogenase activity (40% reduction) compared to an &lt;i&gt;mmdh1-2 &lt;/i&gt; mutant (30% reduction), suggesting that both mMDH1 and mMDH2 are active malate dehydrogenases in Arabidopsis |CITS: [20876337]|. The larger contribution of mMDH1 to the malate dehydrogenase activity is consistent with it being the major isoform found in mitochondria according to proteomic analyses |CITS: [18385124][11743115]|. The exclusive mitochondrial localization of these two MDH family members is further supported by the observation that&lt;i&gt;mmdh1-2 mmdh2-1&lt;/i&gt; double mutants have no detectable mitochondrial malate dehydrogenase activity |CITS: [20876337]|. They have several other abnormalities, such as slow growth, reduced mitochondrial oxidation, and reduced net carbon dioxide assimilation |CITS: [20876337]|. Some aspects of the &lt;i&gt;mmdh1-2 mmdh2-1&lt;/i&gt; double mutant&apos;s phenotype indicate that the mMDHs in Arabidopsis may act primarily on OAA to promote malate formation &lt;i&gt;in vivo&lt;/i&gt;|CITS: [20876337]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT3G15020-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="Mitochondrial MDH2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="mMDH1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="Mitochondrial NAD-dependent malate dehydrogenase 2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_4" value="mNAD-MDH 2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_5" value="mtNAD-MDH2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-7080" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0005739" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT3G15020.1" />
      <Property key="FunctionalAssignmentStatus" value=":AMBIGUOUS" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT3G15020" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="14671022" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <Property key="Locations" value="CCI-MIT-PL" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_20876337" />
    </DataNode>
